    {
      "text": "This morning I hit snooze one too many times and spilled some coffee while rushing around. Then I realized I'd left my keys in yesterday's jacket, so I was digging through pockets before I could get out the door. Once I finally made it outside, the weather was nice. I walked to a caf\u00e9 to get some work done and bumped into my neighbor walking her dog. We chatted about weekend plans and how hard it can be to unplug. At the caf\u00e9, I caught up on emails and decided to take a quick break. I went for a walk through the park and discovered a little bakery I hadn't noticed before, so I grabbed a loaf of bread. The afternoon was productive with a smooth project call full of ideas. Later on, I watered my plants and cooked a simple pasta dinner. [sighs] It wasn't a dramatic day, but the small stuff, spilling coffee, misplacing my keys, and catching up with neighbors kept it from feeling like just another ordinary day.",
